    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d766">

                <pb facs="0981" n="867" sameAs="frus:frus1922v02/pg867"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.01/526</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Chairman of the Special Trade Delegation of
                        the Far Eastern Republic to the United States</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Skvirsky</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-12-04"><hi rendition="#italic">December 4,
                        1922</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to advise you that the
                    National Assembly of the Far Eastern Republic at its session on November 12th.,
                    1922 <pb facs="0982" n="868" xml:id="pg868"/> at Chita had unanimously voted to
                    amalgamate with the Russian Socialist Federated Soviet Republic.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this occasion to express the hope of the people of the Russian
                    Far East for a closer unity between the peoples of Russia and United States of
                    America.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">B. Skvirsky</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
